01:16:16.790 --> 01:16:20.090
My favorite flavor is
Chocolate Cherry Garcia...


01:16:20.190 --> 01:16:24.220
<i>although, technically,
I think that's a frozen yogurt.</i>


01:16:24.330 --> 01:16:27.820
- Okay?
- Okay. Thanks. Bye.


01:16:27.930 --> 01:16:30.400
Bye.


01:16:30.500 --> 01:16:34.030
- Mom, she eats ice cream.
- I heard.


01:16:35.510 --> 01:16:39.240
Your packet has tickets in it,
and there's your badge number.


01:16:39.340 --> 01:16:41.310
- Okay.
- Is there anything else?


01:16:41.410 --> 01:16:44.040
Uh, yeah. Is there a funeral home
around here?


01:16:58.960 --> 01:17:01.630
- Hi.
- Hi.


01:17:03.530 --> 01:17:06.030
<i>Okay, Olive,
let's get your swimsuit on.</i>


01:17:06.140 --> 01:17:08.260
You wanna go change
behind the curtain?


01:17:08.370 --> 01:17:11.710
<i>This is the last touch-up, everybody.
Final touch-ups. Last touch-up.</i>


01:17:43.340 --> 01:17:46.740
<i>- Okay! Wait!
- I won't wait for you!</i>


01:17:47.780 --> 01:17:49.750
Let's get outta here.


01:17:54.190 --> 01:17:56.850
Hey! Hey, Olive Hoover.


01:17:56.950 --> 01:17:59.650
- Mm-hmm?
- Hey, I need your music.


01:17:59.760 --> 01:18:02.320
- Oh, music, right.
- Yeah.


01:18:05.360 --> 01:18:07.330
Where is it? All right.


01:18:09.770 --> 01:18:11.740
Here you go.


01:18:11.840 --> 01:18:15.240
- This? Did you choose this?
- No, my grandpa did.


01:18:15.340 --> 01:18:17.310
- Your grandpa?
- Mm-hmm.


01:18:17.410 --> 01:18:19.380
- Which track?
- Twelve.


01:18:19.480 --> 01:18:24.280
We were drivin' five, six hours.
Thought he was napping.


01:18:24.380 --> 01:18:26.940
By the time we figured it out, it's-


01:18:28.050 --> 01:18:30.080
- You know.
- Too late.


01:18:31.790 --> 01:18:34.350
So where's the body?


01:18:34.460 --> 01:18:36.430
Um-


01:18:51.620 --> 01:18:53.590
Personal effects.


01:18:53.690 --> 01:18:55.660
- Thank you.
- You take care.


01:18:57.290 --> 01:18:59.320
You too.


01:19:21.080 --> 01:19:22.980
<i>I'm ready.</i>


01:19:23.020 --> 01:19:24.310
<i>I'm ready.</i>


01:19:28.160 --> 01:19:31.490
- She was scared, but she did very well.
- Was she?


01:19:35.560 --> 01:19:40.020
<i>Ladies and gentlemen,
welcome to the 24th annual...</i>


01:19:40.130 --> 01:19:43.570
Little Miss Sunshine Pageant!


01:19:43.670 --> 01:19:47.000
<i>Yes!</i>


01:19:47.110 --> 01:19:51.480
Now, please, put your hands together once
again and help me welcome to the stage...


01:19:51.580 --> 01:19:55.810
our 12 beautiful contestants!


01:20:14.940 --> 01:20:16.230
Wow.


01:21:16.510 --> 01:21:21.240
<i>Oh, let's have a big round of applause
for our lovely contestants!</i>


01:21:22.750 --> 01:21:26.150
<i>At the end of the evening,
one of these girls...</i>


01:21:26.250 --> 01:21:29.690
will be crowned
Little Miss Sunshine!


01:21:38.330 --> 01:21:41.060
<i>Olive, honey,
are you okay in there?</i>


01:21:41.170 --> 01:21:43.130
<i>Yeah, I'm fine.</i>


01:21:45.770 --> 01:21:47.670
Hey.


01:21:48.970 --> 01:21:50.870
What?


01:21:50.980 --> 01:21:54.040
<i>You got a kid in the show?</i>


01:21:54.150 --> 01:21:56.110
Your first time?


01:21:56.210 --> 01:21:58.180
Yeah, yeah.


01:22:46.660 --> 01:22:49.390
<i>America!</i>


01:22:49.500 --> 01:22:51.590
<i>It's so beautiful!</i>


01:22:54.570 --> 01:22:58.570
<i>Sometimes I just wish
I could go to sleep till I was 18...</i>


01:22:58.680 --> 01:23:03.810
and skip all this crap- high school
and everything-just skip it.


01:23:06.220 --> 01:23:08.690
You know Marcel Proust?


01:23:08.790 --> 01:23:11.310
- He's the guy you teach.
- Yeah.


01:23:11.420 --> 01:23:14.790
French writer.
Total loser.


01:23:14.890 --> 01:23:16.950
Never had a real job.


01:23:17.060 --> 01:23:20.290
Unrequited love affairs. Gay.


01:23:20.400 --> 01:23:23.330
Spent 20 years writing a book
almost no one reads.


01:23:23.430 --> 01:23:25.730
But he's also probably
the greatest writer since Shakespeare.


01:23:25.840 --> 01:23:30.210
Anyway, he, uh-
he gets down to the end of his life...


01:23:30.310 --> 01:23:33.370
and he looks back and decides
that all those years he suffered-


01:23:33.480 --> 01:23:37.640
Those were the best years of his life,
'cause they made him who he was.


01:23:37.750 --> 01:23:41.650
All the years he was happy? You know,
total waste. Didn't learn a thing.


01:23:41.750 --> 01:23:45.950
So, if you sleep until you're 18...


01:23:46.060 --> 01:23:49.520
ah, think of the suffering
you're gonna miss.


01:23:49.640 --> 01:23:53.300
I mean, high school? High school-
Those are your prime suffering years.


01:23:53.410 --> 01:23:55.880
You don't get better suffering
than that.


01:23:59.850 --> 01:24:01.820
You know what?


01:24:03.620 --> 01:24:05.590
Fuck beauty contests.


01:24:06.890 --> 01:24:10.190
Life is one fucking
beauty contest after another.


01:24:10.290 --> 01:24:13.850
You know, school,
then college, then work?


01:24:13.960 --> 01:24:15.930
Fuck that.


01:24:16.030 --> 01:24:18.160
And fuck the Air Force Academy.


01:24:18.270 --> 01:24:22.400
If I wanna fly,
I'll find a way to fly.


01:24:22.500 --> 01:24:25.440
You do what you love,
and fuck the rest.


01:24:31.380 --> 01:24:33.680
I'm glad you're talkin' again, Dwayne.


01:24:35.920 --> 01:24:38.780
You're not nearly as stupid as you look.


01:24:46.130 --> 01:24:48.090
Wanna go back?


01:24:48.200 --> 01:24:50.600
Not really.


01:24:52.000 --> 01:24:54.830
Yeah, we should go back.


01:24:57.340 --> 01:25:00.740
<i>And now, the moment
we've all been waiting for-</i>


01:25:00.840 --> 01:25:03.240
the talent competition.


01:25:14.320 --> 01:25:16.260
Miss Carly Nugent.


01:25:45.420 --> 01:25:47.850
Yee-haw!


01:25:47.960 --> 01:25:50.520
<i>Yodel-lay-he-hoo, that was great!</i>


01:26:08.140 --> 01:26:10.170
<i>Wow-ow-ow-ow!</i>


01:26:10.280 --> 01:26:12.750
<i>Funky-licious!</i>


01:26:34.380 --> 01:26:36.510
<i>I'm goin' backstage.</i>


01:26:36.610 --> 01:26:38.580
Yeah, right. See ya.


01:26:41.820 --> 01:26:45.050
Oh, look at you.
Is that your costume?


01:26:45.160 --> 01:26:47.120
Mm-hmm.


01:26:48.160 --> 01:26:50.150
Okay, here.


01:26:52.700 --> 01:26:56.430
- Hey, what's goin' on?
- Oh, I just- I came to wish Olive good luck.


01:26:56.530 --> 01:26:58.900
- How you doin', honey?
- Good.


01:26:59.000 --> 01:27:00.940
- Nervous.
- Yeah. You're gonna do great.


01:27:01.040 --> 01:27:03.730
I just know it.


01:27:03.840 --> 01:27:06.670
- Can I talk to you for a second?
- Yeah.


01:27:06.780 --> 01:27:09.250
What's up?


01:27:11.280 --> 01:27:13.410
I don't want her to go on.


01:27:16.350 --> 01:27:19.290
- Are you authorized to be backstage?
- No. Hey.


01:27:19.390 --> 01:27:21.860
<i>- Where are the dressing rooms?
- Are you allowed to be here?</i>


01:27:21.960 --> 01:27:23.930
Just tell me where
the dressing rooms are.


01:27:24.030 --> 01:27:28.190
<i>Listen, we're not in Albuquerque anymore.</i>


01:27:28.300 --> 01:27:30.630
- Hey, how are you feeling?
- Better. Where's Olive?


01:27:30.730 --> 01:27:33.200
- There. What's up?
- Mom, I don't want Olive doing this.


01:27:33.300 --> 01:27:35.640
Oh, my God!


01:27:35.740 --> 01:27:38.260
- Look around. This place is fucked!
- He's right!


01:27:38.380 --> 01:27:41.070
Look, I don't want these
people judging Olive. Fuck them!


01:27:41.180 --> 01:27:44.710
- Listen, it is too late.
- No, it's not too late. You're the mom...


01:27:44.820 --> 01:27:47.480
and you're supposed to protect her.


01:27:47.580 --> 01:27:52.650
Everyone is gonna laugh at her, Mom.
Please don't let her do this.


01:27:52.760 --> 01:27:55.590
<i>Olive Hoover, two minutes.</i>


01:27:55.690 --> 01:27:58.560
<i>Look, she's not a beauty queen.</i>


01:27:58.660 --> 01:28:00.790
<i>She's just not.</i>


01:28:00.900 --> 01:28:04.800
- I'm gonna tell her.
- No, Dwayne. You listen to me. Olive is who she is.


01:28:04.900 --> 01:28:07.430
<i>She has worked so hard.
She's poured everything into this.</i>


01:28:07.540 --> 01:28:11.530
We can't just take it away
from her. We can't.


01:28:11.640 --> 01:28:16.640
I know you wanna protect her. I know, honey,
but... we gotta let Olive be Olive.


01:28:16.750 --> 01:28:20.080
<i>Olive Hoover. Are you the family?</i>


01:28:20.180 --> 01:28:22.210
Yeah. Okay?


01:28:23.920 --> 01:28:26.750
Olive, it's time. Okay?


01:28:26.860 --> 01:28:28.920
Yeah.


01:28:29.030 --> 01:28:31.690
- We gotta go now.
- Hang on.


01:28:31.800 --> 01:28:34.860
Olive, look at me.


01:28:34.970 --> 01:28:37.870
If you don't want to do this,
that's okay.


01:28:37.970 --> 01:28:42.530
If you want to sit this one out, it's totally
fine by us. We're proud of you anyway.


01:28:43.640 --> 01:28:45.610
<i>We gotta go.</i>


01:28:47.850 --> 01:28:49.810
<i>It's time.</i>


01:28:59.060 --> 01:29:01.030
Ready? Let's go.


01:29:12.950 --> 01:29:15.040
Good luck, honey.


01:29:15.150 --> 01:29:17.710
Copy that. Twenty-five
is performance ready...


01:29:17.820 --> 01:29:19.950
and we're walkin'...


01:29:20.050 --> 01:29:22.020
as fast as we can.


01:29:24.730 --> 01:29:26.690
- Is she going on?
- Yeah.


01:29:26.790 --> 01:29:28.760
She's going on.


01:29:31.800 --> 01:29:33.770
<i>Pure fairy-tale magic.</i>


01:29:33.870 --> 01:29:36.060
Miss Charisma Whiteman!


01:29:37.100 --> 01:29:39.270
Wasn't that a stardust fantasy?


01:29:39.440 --> 01:29:43.380
<i>Thank you for that.
You have been such a patient audience.</i>


01:29:43.480 --> 01:29:46.470
<i>We have one more contestant,
and then we'll be crowning our winner.</i>


01:29:46.580 --> 01:29:49.110
<i>Please give a warm welcome to...</i>


01:29:49.220 --> 01:29:52.910
<i>Miss... Olive Hoover!</i>


01:30:07.400 --> 01:30:09.370
You okay?


01:30:09.470 --> 01:30:13.740
Um, I'd like to dedicate this
to my grandpa...


01:30:13.840 --> 01:30:16.070
who showed me these moves.


01:30:16.180 --> 01:30:18.910
<i>Oh, that is so sweet!</i>


01:30:19.010 --> 01:30:21.880
<i>Is he here?
Where is your grandpa right now?</i>


01:30:21.980 --> 01:30:25.320
In the trunk of our car.


01:30:25.420 --> 01:30:27.390
Okay!


01:30:27.490 --> 01:30:29.960
<i>Well, take it away, Olive!</i>


01:30:45.540 --> 01:30:47.100
Huh!


01:31:22.480 --> 01:31:25.140
<i>You suck!</i>


01:31:25.250 --> 01:31:28.010
<i>Those little fuckers. I will kill them.</i>


01:31:28.120 --> 01:31:30.350
<i>You stink!</i>


01:31:38.340 --> 01:31:40.500
No, no, no, no, no.


01:32:11.300 --> 01:32:13.770
What is your daughter doing?


01:32:21.040 --> 01:32:24.010
She's kickin' ass.
That's what she's doin'.


01:32:38.730 --> 01:32:41.200
Get over here!
Get over here!


01:32:41.300 --> 01:32:45.230
<i>- I want that little ragamuffin off the stage this minute.
- All right.</i>


01:32:45.340 --> 01:32:47.800
- Get her. Right this minute!
- Don't touch- Don't touch her.


01:32:47.900 --> 01:32:51.470
- Your act's over, honey.
- Hey!


01:32:53.640 --> 01:32:56.610
- Hey! Hey, let go of my daughter!
- Oh!


01:32:56.710 --> 01:33:00.150
Holy sh-


01:33:00.250 --> 01:33:03.010
Let her finish!


01:33:04.890 --> 01:33:08.320
<i>Get off me!
Help! Get off me!</i>


01:33:08.430 --> 01:33:10.950
- Help me!
- Take charge! Just take charge!


01:33:11.060 --> 01:33:13.290
<i>Keep dancin', honey!
Daddy's okay.</i>


01:33:13.400 --> 01:33:18.600
Get your daughter
off this stage right now!


01:33:18.700 --> 01:33:20.670
Now!


01:33:25.780 --> 01:33:27.740
<i>Honey?</i>


01:33:44.900 --> 01:33:46.860
<i>- Like that?
- Oh!</i>


01:34:39.460 --> 01:34:41.430
- Ooh!
- Ah!


01:34:51.710 --> 01:34:55.400
Yeah! All right!


01:35:10.690 --> 01:35:13.420
Okay, you're out-


01:35:13.530 --> 01:35:16.720
on the condition that you never enter
your daughter in a beauty pageant...


01:35:16.830 --> 01:35:19.260
in the state of California ever again.


01:35:19.370 --> 01:35:21.330
Ever.


01:35:23.540 --> 01:35:25.830
I think we can live with that.


01:35:30.610 --> 01:35:33.770
All right.
We're back in business.


01:35:33.880 --> 01:35:36.540
Lock and load.


01:35:49.600 --> 01:35:52.930
Olive, your grandpa would've
been really proud of you.


01:35:53.030 --> 01:35:55.930
<i>- Yeah, you were great. Mm-wah!
- You were beyond great.</i>


01:35:56.040 --> 01:35:59.560
<i>- You were incredible.
- Thank you.</i>


01:36:03.140 --> 01:36:05.110
Let's get outta here.


01:36:29.400 --> 01:36:31.100
Whoo!


01:36:33.710 --> 01:36:35.640
It's in gear.


01:36:47.000 --> 01:36:49.470
What in the world?
